      "text": "Day 2 · After breakfast, a half-day excursion to Sugar Loaf with an English-speaking guide. From Praia Vermelha, the cable car stops first at Urca Hill before continuing to the summit, with breathtaking panoramic views over Rio, Copacabana Beach, Guanabara Bay, the surrounding mountains, the islands and Christ the Redeemer. Then drive to the old centre of Rio, with its historic churches, monasteries, cathedral and colonial-style buildings.",
